<view class="page"><view class="title">问题反馈</view><view class="card"><view>让拾语更好用</view><view class="muted">直接发送至开发者 1363578991@qq.com，不附带你的日记或生词。</view><view class="label">标题</view><input value="{{subject}}" data-field="subject" bindinput="input" maxlength="100" placeholder="至少 2 个字"/><view class="label">建议或问题</view><textarea value="{{message}}" data-field="message" bindinput="input" maxlength="3000" placeholder="请描述你的建议或操作步骤（至少 5 字）"/><view class="label">联系邮箱（选填）</view><input value="{{replyTo}}" data-field="replyTo" bindinput="input" maxlength="254"/><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view class="notice" wx:if="{{status}}">{{status}}</view><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || subject.length &lt; 2 || message.length &lt; 5}}" bindtap="send">发送反馈</button></view></view>
